From 56bf5e06add6051354ed7b4c20c50a7147d5f318 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zerollama <zerollama@local>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 10:50:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] server: Bee-inspired reasoning loop guard (Lab B0)

Add opt-in --reasoning-loop-guard (default off) with force-close/stop modes.
Detector from BeeLlama; wired via process_token + reasoning_budget_tracking
(our pin lacks Bee accept-callbacks). Also fix stale check_no_mtmd in
SLOT_SEQ_COPY to use check_slot_no_media.
